  "body_markdown": "Book Appointment\n\nEST\n\n1974\n\n50 Years of Oral Surgery Care\n\nVisit our oral surgery practice in mid-city Santa Monica.\n\nWith 50 years of experience, we specialize in various oral health treatments, from reconstructive to orthognathic surgery.\n\nVisit our oral surgery practice in mid-city Santa Monica. With 50 years of experience, we specialize in various oral health treatments, from reconstructive to orthognathic surgery.\n\nWe are proud to serve residents from Santa Monica, Pacific Palisades, Malibu, Brentwood, Westwood, Marina Del Rey, Playa Del Rey, Playa Vista, Westchester, Culver City, West Los Angeles, Venice, Century City and the San Fernando Valley.\n\nWe will schedule your appointment as promptly as possible. If you have emergent pain or discomfort, we will do our best to see you that day.\n\nWe make every effort to stay on schedule and minimize your wait time. However, Santa Monica Center for Oral Surgery and Dental Implants provides many types of surgical services and various circumstances may lengthen the time allocated for a procedure. Emergency cases may also arise and cause delays. We appreciate your patience and understanding.\n\n\n### Meet our Team\n\n\n\n### Meet our Team\n\n\nWe are very proud of the excellent care we provide our patients. Get to know our team of surgeons.\n\nLearn More\n\n\n### Park\n\n\n\n### Ting\n\n\n\n### Ivry\n\n\n\n### Tanner\n\n\n\n### Vajda\n\n\n\n### Schwartz\n\n\n\n## Transform Your Smile Today\n\n\n\n### Transform Your Smile Today\n\n\nExperience the Difference of Our Innovative Dental Procedures\n\n\n### Our Office\n\n\nTake a virtual tour of our modern and inviting office\n\n\n#### Patient Feedback Highlights\n\n\nExceptional care from start to finish. The expertise and the staff's attention to detail made my implant surgery a success. Highly recommend!\n\nAfter a bad experience elsewhere, I was nervous about oral surgery. The team here made me feel comfortable and the results exceeded my expectations.\n\nProfessional, skilled, and caring. The best oral surgery experience I could have asked for. Thank you for giving me back my smile!\n\n\n#### Patient Feedback Highlights\n\n\n\n#### Patient Feedback Highlights\n\n\n\n### Ready to Transform Your Smile? Schedule Your Beverly Hills Consultation Today\n\n\nDon't let dental concerns hold you back from the confidence and oral health you deserve. Our Beverly Hills location offers the same exceptional care that has made us the premier choice for oral surgery in West Los Angeles and Beverly Hills for 50 years.\n\nBook Your Beverly Hills Appointment\n\n\n##### Ready to Transform Your Smile? Schedule Your Beverly Hills Consultation Today\n\n\n\n##### Ready to Transform Your Smile? Schedule Your Beverly Hills Consultation Today\n\n\n\n#### Location\n\n\nWe'd love to hear from you. Contact us today!\n\n\n##### Email\n\n\nSend us an email\n\ninfo@santamonicaoms.com\n\n\n##### Address\n\n\n2001 Wilshire Blvd, Ste. 600\n\nSanta Monica, CA 90403\n\n\n##### Phone\n\n\nGive us a call\n\n(310) 315-1034\n\n\n#### Office Hours\n\n\nClosed on Sunday and public holidays.\n\nMonday\n\nTuesday\n\nWednesday\n\nThursday\n\nFriday\n\nSaturday\n\nSunday\n\n7 am - 5 pm\n\n7 am - 4:30 pm\n\nClosed\n\n\n###### Email\n\n\n\n###### Address\n\n\n\n###### Phone\n\n\n\n###### Office Hours\n\n\nLocation\n\n\n#### Location\n\n\n\n##### Email\n\n\n\n##### Address\n\n\n\n##### Phone\n\n\n\n#### Office Hours\n\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\nAbout Us\n\nOur Surgeons\n\nOur Office\n\nTestimonials\n\nBlog\n\nReferring Doctors\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\nOrthognathic (jaw) Surgery\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nSinus Lift\n\nFacial Trauma\n\nTeeth-in-an-Hour™\n\nAll-on-four Dental Implants\n\nDental Implants\n\nWisdom Teeth Removal\n\n\n###### For Patients\n\n\nPay Your Bill\n\nFirst Visit\n\nPatient Registration\n\nFinancial Information\n\nBefore Anesthesia\n\nAfter Dental Implant Surgery\n\nAfter Tooth Extraction\n\nAfter Wisdom Tooth Surgery\n\nAfter Exposure Of An Impacted Tooth\n\nAfter The Removal Of Multiple Teeth\n\nJaw Fracture\n\nOrthognathic Surgery\n\nSinus Augmentation\n\n© 2025 Santa Monica Center. All rights reserved.\n\nWebsite by\n\n7Seas\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\n\n###### For Patients\n\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\n\n###### For Patients",
